Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         apt (>= 1.0),
         gnupg,
Description: Rust implementation of add-apt-repository
 This package provides a Rust-based implementation of the add-apt-repository
 command, offering the same functionality as the Python version from the
 software-properties-common package.
 .
 It can be installed alongside the original command and provides:
  - PPA repository management
  - Cloud Archive support
  - GPG key handling
  - Authentication for private repositories
  - Sources list management
